---
source: crates/il-nodes/src/ai/common.rs
expression: combined
---
write: Write the requested text using the user's instructions. Follow the chosen tone and length. Return only the finished text.
summarise: Summarise the supplied text faithfully. Do not invent facts. Follow the requested format and length. Return only the summary.
classify: Choose exactly one of the supplied labels. Return JSON with a single "label" string matching a label name. Do not create new labels.
extract: Extract only fields supported by the supplied text. Return a JSON object matching the requested schema. Use null when a value is missing.
translate: Translate the supplied text into the requested language. Preserve meaning and, when requested, formatting. Return only the translation.
decide: Answer the question using the supplied input. Return JSON with one "label" value: yes or no, or exactly one supplied label name.
agent: Answer using available knowledge and tools when useful. Cite sources from knowledge results. Never invent tool results. Return a clear final answer.
describe_image: Describe the referenced image or answer the supplied question about it. State uncertainty when the image cannot be inspected.
